    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank is infected with a mysterious virus, slowly breaking him down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's made him weak and helpless. And you must protect him at<strong> </strong><i>all costs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can keep him alive long enough, maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll find a way to <i>cure him.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous levels, overcome brutal enemy encounters, and use your one and only offensive tool<strong>\u00a0- </strong>the <u>Surge</u> ability <strong>-\u00a0</strong>to clear a path for Frank and keep him from falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Surge Ability</strong> \u2013 More than just a powered-up dash, <i>Surge</i> is your primary weapon, your problem-solving tool, and your way of interacting with the world. Use it to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Deflect \u2013 Redirect enemy projectiles back at them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Attack \u2013 Strike enemies by surging off of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Blast \u2013 Surge off Frank to unleash a swarm of homing missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Explosion \u2013 When Frank takes damage, he drops a glowing orb. Surge off it to create <i>a remote bomb</i>\u2014which can <i>heal Frank</i> if timed correctly!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming Meets Tactical Combat</strong> \u2013 Every level is a unique challenge. Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal platforming gauntlets that test your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of enemies that require quick thinking and strategic use of Surge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle sections where you and Frank work together to activate switches and unlock paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles &amp; Insane Challenges</strong> \u2013 Face off against deadly bosses, fight through absurdly difficult bonus levels, and prove your mastery of Surge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>one of the most unique platformers you\u2019ll ever play.</i> You\u2019ve never protected an NPC like this before. You\u2019ve never used a movement ability quite like Surge<strong>.</strong> And you\u2019ve never played anything quite like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck. <strong>Frank\u2019s life is in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frank is infected with a mysterious virus, slowly breaking him down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's made him weak and helpless. And you must protect him at<strong> </strong><i>all costs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can keep him alive long enough, maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll find a way to <i>cure him.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous levels, overcome brutal enemy encounters, and use your one and only offensive tool<strong>\u00a0- </strong>the <u>Surge</u> ability <strong>-\u00a0</strong>to clear a path for Frank and keep him from falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/5960fbf0a3fa1cfecf3f0f6db2fc4717.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Surge Ability</strong> \u2013 More than just a powered-up dash, <i>Surge</i> is your primary weapon, your problem-solving tool, and your way of interacting with the world. Use it to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Deflect \u2013 Redirect enemy projectiles back at them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Attack \u2013 Strike enemies by surging off of them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Blast \u2013 Surge off Frank to unleash a swarm of homing missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surge Explosion \u2013 When Frank takes damage, he drops a glowing orb. Surge off it to create <i>a remote bomb</i>\u2014which can <i>heal Frank</i> if timed correctly!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/a1636cc5e1ffb40004994eac0e5fd55e.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming Meets Tactical Combat</strong> \u2013 Every level is a unique challenge. Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal platforming gauntlets that test your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless waves of enemies that require quick thinking and strategic use of Surge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle sections where you and Frank work together to activate switches and unlock paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.poster.avif?t=1749483432\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.webm?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489880/extras/8e1593ddfab679cb2f73362db3127bb3.mp4?t=1749483432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles &amp; Insane Challenges</strong> \u2013 Face off against deadly bosses, fight through absurdly difficult bonus levels, and prove your mastery of Surge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>one of the most unique platformers you\u2019ll ever play.</i> You\u2019ve never protected an NPC like this before. You\u2019ve never used a movement ability quite like Surge<strong>.</strong> And you\u2019ve never played anything quite like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck. <strong>Frank\u2019s life is in your hands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A tough precision platformer where you must keep Frank, a fragile NPC, alive. Use the powerful Surge ability to unleash destruction on enemies, AND even heal Frank. Navigate BRUTALLY difficult levels, solve puzzles, and master tactical combat in one of the most unique platformers you'll ever play",
